# =============================================================================
# Nexus Launcher - repo nay CHI chua phan web ma Vercel can serve.
# Hai phien ban song song:
#   /          -> ban THUONG  (UI/GUI goc: index.html + style.css)
#   /Youtube/  -> ban YOUTUBE (UI/GUI da rework: index.html + css/ + js/)
#   /api/      -> serverless dung CHUNG cho ca hai
# Moi thu khac (ma nguon Python, cookie, cache, ban dung thu) deu bi chan.
# =============================================================================

# 1) Chan tat ca
/*

# 2) Mo lai dung nhung thu can cho Vercel
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/package.json

# --- ban THUONG (goc) o root ---
!/index.html
!/style.css

# --- thu muc duoc phep ---
!/api/
!/Youtube/

# 3) Trong tung thu muc cung chi cho phep dung loai file
api/*
!api/*.js

Youtube/*
!Youtube/index.html
!Youtube/Logo_NexusT.png
!Youtube/css/
!Youtube/js/

Youtube/css/*
!Youtube/css/*.css

Youtube/js/*
!Youtube/js/*.js
!Youtube/js/*.jsx
